{"id":"n20235-2-13","stage":0,"title":"아기 · 宝宝","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20235-2-13-1","ko":"엄마, 저기 봐요, 아기 토끼예요.","zh":"妈妈，看那边，是小兔子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요,","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}},{"text":"아기","meaning":"宝宝","explanation":"아기：宝宝。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"2","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}},{"text":"토끼예요.","meaning":"兔，兔子","explanation":"토끼：兔，兔子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"토끼","audio":"/audio/fbd1f98ced90a29bfbc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89388","senseId":"1","lemma":"토끼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토끼예요","audio":"/audio/5bc4f47cc39ca45f4e06.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"宝宝","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"(昵称)动物的小崽子或幼小的植物。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"fbd1f98ced90a29b","term":"토끼","zh":"兔，兔子","audio":"/audio/fbd1f98ced90a29bfbc9.mp3","entryId":"89388","definition":"一种耳朵长、尾巴短、后腿比前腿发达的动物。","pronunciation":["토끼"]}],"audio":"/audio/61ae1e95ff0663f16a3a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20235-2-13-2","ko":"어머, 귀여워라. 엄마 토끼는 어디 있을까?","zh":"哎呀，真可爱。兔妈妈在哪里呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦。","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"귀여워라.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀여워라","audio":"/audio/04b26ff91fccb0c7846c.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"토끼는","meaning":"兔，兔子","explanation":"토끼：兔，兔子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"토끼","audio":"/audio/fbd1f98ced90a29bfbc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89388","senseId":"1","lemma":"토끼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토끼는","audio":"/audio/a3e60693e1a5fd1be8b7.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"있을까?","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을까","audio":"/audio/263e0eb545ea59d74b53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"fbd1f98ced90a29b","term":"토끼","zh":"兔，兔子","audio":"/audio/fbd1f98ced90a29bfbc9.mp3","entryId":"89388","definition":"一种耳朵长、尾巴短、后腿比前腿发达的动物。","pronunciation":["토끼"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0920972038459606674e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.998,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=20235","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2491,"questions":[{"lineIndex"